# Root of the phone-app repo (project folder "capstone app/").
# Capstone_Android/.gitignore (and app/.gitignore) still apply inside that
# folder; this file adds the rules for everything around it.

# ---- Someone else's repo ---------------------------------------------------
# Script-Checker-Web-End is the teammate's repo
# (github.com/Undying2021Dreams/Script-Checker-Web-End), with its own .git.
# Nothing from it is ever committed here; the README links to it instead.
/Script-Checker-Web-End/

# ---- Legacy code (history only, never part of this repo) --------------------
# ASC_Capstone is its own git root (old Node server); v-2.1.1 is the old
# teacher worksheet system.
/ASC_Capstone/
/v-2.1.1/

# ---- Machine config and secrets --------------------------------------------
# Unanchored on purpose: covers Capstone_Android/local.properties (sdk.dir,
# Entra client ids, signature hash) and any .env at any depth. Templates stay.
local.properties
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Signing keys and anything that looks like one.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pem
# Claude Code's per-user settings (CLAUDE.md itself IS committed).
.claude/settings.local.json

# ---- Model weights ---------------------------------------------------------
# gemma-4-E2B-it (2.6 GB), Qwen2-VL-2B (1.7 GB), LLaVA-OneVision-0.5B
# (810 MB), gemma3-1b-it-int4 (570 MB). Downloaded separately and pushed to
# the phone with adb; see README.md.
*.litertlm
*.task
*.tflite

# ---- Gradle / Kotlin / Android build output --------------------------------
build/
.gradle/
.kotlin/
.cxx/
.externalNativeBuild/
captures/
*.apk
*.aab
*.apks
*.ap_
*.dex
*.hprof
*.log
# Machine-specific daemon JDK pin (also ignored by Capstone_Android/.gitignore).
gradle/gradle-daemon-jvm.properties

# ---- Gradle wrapper: MUST stay tracked --------------------------------------
# gradlew / gradlew.bat need it to build on a fresh clone. Nothing above
# matches it; this line guards against a future *.jar rule.
!Capstone_Android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

# ---- Stray screenshots, photos and printouts in the root -------------------
# adb screenshots (marks.png, upload.png, shot.png ...), phone photos and
# printed worksheets pile up here during testing. Anchored to the top level on
# purpose: an unanchored *.png would also drop the test fixtures under
# Capstone_Android/**/src/test/resources and the launcher icons.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.webp
/*.heic
/*.gif
/*.bmp
/*.mp4
/*.pdf
/*.zip

# ---- Local caches / IDE ----------------------------------------------------
.cache/
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.fleet/
*.swp
*~

# ---- OS cruft --------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
